# Line endings — so that CI and local development see the same thing.
#
# .editorconfig asks for `end_of_line = crlf` and `dotnet format --verify-no-changes`
# checks that on the WORKING COPY. Without this file:
#   - on Windows autocrlf makes the working copy CRLF     → the check passes
#   - on ubuntu-latest CI the checkout gives LF            → the check breaks
# so the error appears only in CI and cannot be reproduced locally.
#
# `eol=crlf` pins the checkout to CRLF on every platform. The blobs in the repo stay
# LF (text=auto), so the history and the diffs are not disturbed.
* text=auto eol=crlf

# Binary files are exempt from conversion — it would corrupt them.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.wav binary
*.ogg binary
*.mp3 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.zip binary
*.pdf binary
